Error [jet.ValueThrownAway]: This Int value is thrown away
  --> value_carrying_return_resultless.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     source() ?? return Err("resultless failure")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `helper` has no return type, so it returns nothing and the value of its last line is lost
 Fix: If `helper` should return it, write `-> Int` after its parameter list; to discard it on purpose, write `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433
